</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1714165"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Nulis Wilangan Cacah nganggo Nilai Panggonan</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-849">Ing latihan iki, tulisen saben wilangan cacah nganggo digit.</para><exercise id="fs-id226532">
