<para id="fs-id3228060"><emphasis effect="bold">Ayo Mbunderake Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-406">Ing latihan iki, bunderna saben wilangan menyang nilai panggonan sing paling cedhak kaya sing dijaluk.</para><exercise id="fs-id2188696"><problem id="fs-id2751447">
<para id="fs-id1348283">Bunderna menyang puluhan sing paling cedhak: <list id="eip-id1168288303519" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>386</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2,931</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
